# Every text file is checked out with LF, even on Windows with core.autocrlf=true:
# - bash fails on CRLF ("$'\r': command not found")
# - Terraform hashes the Lambda zips and web files, so CRLF on one machine and
#   LF on another makes each apply re-upload code that has not changed
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never convert
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
